        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "requirements.md",
          "language": "md",
          "contents": "# UI Elements (StarSage: Zodiac Fortune Teller)\n\n- **Image**: `main-image`\n- **Output text box**: `output`\n- **Buttons**:\n  - `aries-btn` (Aries)\n  - `taurus-btn` (Taurus)\n  - `gemini-btn` (Gemini)\n  - `cancer-btn` (Cancer)\n  - `leo-btn` (Leo)\n\n## Behavior\n- **Click a button** updates `#output` with a hardcoded fortune for that zodiac sign.\n- **App load** shows a starter message in `#output` prompting the user to choose a sign.\n- **No console errors** and repeated clicks are safe.",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
