    "long_instructions": "##Fortune Teller App\r\n\r\n**Dcoument the UI** (buttons and output) in the Activity Guide\r\n\r\n**Explore**: Create additional buttons in HTML; `querySelector` each; add `click` listeners; in handlers, update `output` text.\r\n\r\n**Test every button** with the debug checklist; fix issues.\r\n\r\n**Use AI** to clarify terms, generate short display text (fortunes/zodiac signs), and translate errors.",
